534	     * {@code 'PREMIUM'} when {@linkplain #getMembershipLevel() membershipLevel} is 3 or more,
535	     * otherwise {@code 'STANDARD'}. AREA is {@code 'METRO'} when the owner's
536	     * {@linkplain #getLocality() locality} is a known region (NSW, VIC or QLD), otherwise
