728	    /**
729	     * The domain of an email address: the part after the last {@code '@'}, lower-cased, or
730	     * {@code null} when the email is {@code null} or carries no {@code '@'} (an empty local part or
731	     * empty domain is kept as-is). This is the single place an email's domain is read, shared by
732	     * every rule keyed by the email domain so the domain is never re-parsed elsewhere.
733	     */
