Mapping: `OwnerMapper` (MapStruct) at `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`. `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` is used inbound with `@Mapping(target = "id", ignore = true)` and `@Mapping(target = "pets", ignore = true)`. Outbound `toOwnerDto(Owner)` sets `apiVersion=2` and nests `identity.memberId/identityKey/householdId`. Note `owner.setEmail(...)` lower-cases the email (Owner.java line 184), so mapping the DTO email stores it lower-cased.

